    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white shadow-sm sticky-top">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand logo" href="/Home/Index"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i><span>ToolShare</span></a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav" aria-controls="mainNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center gap-lg-2">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/Index"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/tools"><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Browse Tools</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/howitworks">How It Works</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/Home/support">Support</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/Home/login">Login</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/Home/register">Register</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
                <p class="lead text-muted">Quick answers about renting, deposits, and safety.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">How does the deposit work?</button></h2>
                    <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">The deposit is held in escrow when you book. It is released back to you after the tool is returned safely and passes inspection. If damage is reported and confirmed, part or all of it may be used for repairs.</div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">What is the QR handover?</button></h2>
                    <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">At pickup and return, both parties scan a QR code at the library desk. This creates a timestamped record and triggers condition photos, protecting both borrower and owner.</div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">What if the tool is damaged?</button></h2>
                    <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Report damage immediately through the damage report form with photos. The librarian reviews evidence, and a decision is made on deposit release or partial refund.</div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">Can I extend my rental?</button></h2>
                    <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Yes — if the tool is still available after your return date, you can request an extension through the booking detail page before the due time.</div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq5">How do I become a Pro member?</button></h2>
                    <div id="faq5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Pro members get lower commissions and priority placement. Eligibility is based on completed rentals and good standing.</div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer py-4 mt-5"><div class="container text-center text-muted"><p class="mb-1">© 2024 ToolShare. All rights reserved.</p><div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3"><a href="/Home/about" class="text-decoration-none">About</a><a href="/Home/support" class="text-decoration-none">Support</a><a href="/Home/terms" class="text-decoration-none">Terms of Service</a></div></div></footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
